{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33618","headline":"秋日陪陆校书游玉泉 · 许棠","name":"秋日陪陆校书游玉泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共爱泉源异，频来不觉劳。\n散光垂草细，繁响出风高。\n沫滞潭花片，沙遗浴鸟毛。\n尘间喧与闷，须向此中逃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}